behavior standards than those required by law, or by CVM itself. This is why non-compliance with this code is not subject to punishment by CVM. This code contains recommendations by Comissão de Valores Mobiliários (CVM – the Securities and Exchange Commission of Brazil) on good corporate governance practices. The adoption of such practices usually implies higher behavior standards than those required by law, or by CVM itself. This is why non-compliance with this code is not subject to punishment by CVM.', 'Brazil', 'governance', 'in_force', '2002-01-01'::date, 'Brazil', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/22_54', ARRAY['guidance_frameworks', 'sdg16', 'disclosure', 'brazil', 'voluntary']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('c3866b4d-e8e2-51d0-9f24-69e02a7446bb', 'Overview of Corporate Governance in Brazil', 'Overview of Corporate Governance in Brazil', 'This work was prepared with the simple objective of informing and contributing to the debate on corporate governance, and therefore does not intend to exhaust or conclude the study of the topic.', 'This work was prepared with the simple objective of informing and contributing to the debate on corporate governance, and therefore does not intend to exhaust or conclude the study of the topic.', 'This work was prepared with the simple objective of informing and contributing to the debate on corporate governance, and therefore does not intend to exhaust or conclude the study of the topic.', 'Brazil', 'governance', 'in_force', '2001-01-01'::date, 'Brazil', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/22_30', ARRAY['other sustainability policy', 'brazil', 'mandatory', 'sdg16', 'mandatory_regulations', 'sdg9']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
